# Geometry/template resources are loaded at runtime by filesystem path
# (e.g. rigid_obj.py and otp_molecule_class.py resolve `<pkg>/resources/<name>.txt`),
# so they must be shipped in the distribution or those object classes break on a real install.
recursive-include pressomancy/resources *.txt
recursive-include pressomancy/resources *.py

include LICENSE
include README.md
